stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Booting
    Booting --> Observe : scoped SessionStart startup/resume/clear
    [*] --> Observe : daemon restore of verified live source
    Observe --> Waiting : Running or Unknown
    Waiting --> Observe : scoped Stop wake or periodic transcript read
    Observe --> DraftVeto : current Idle or first SessionStart proof
    DraftVeto --> Held : Person draft / unread / protected focus
    Held --> Observe : automatic observation and same-original wake
    Held --> Held : persistent unread; progress boundary RED
    DraftVeto --> Prepared : draft admission permits existing policy
    Prepared --> Observe : source / turn / cancellation changed before first key
    Prepared --> Running : revalidate + existing first-key fence + one submit
    Running --> Observe : next current terminal
    Running --> Settled : exact original receipt; no replay of Unknown
    Settled --> Observe : next original
    Observe --> CompactPending : occupancy crossing remembered
    CompactPending --> Running : current terminal after Stop-equivalent boundary + Idle + draft admission
    Observe --> ScreenStall : before model requires marker/busy/MCP confirmation
    ScreenStall --> ScreenStall : 46 columns or redraw never confirms; progress RED
